      <div class="modal__container" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-lei-expired-title">
        <header class="modal__header">
          <h5 class="modal__title" id="modal-lei-expired-title">
            Important notice          </h5>
          <button class="modal__close" aria-label="Close modal" data-micromodal-close></button>
        </header>
        <main class="modal__content" id="modal-lei-expired-content">
                        <p>The LEI code of your company has expired! In order to update the data, it is also necessary to extend the validity of the LEI code in the international GLEIF database. We ask for most of the necessary data from the Ministry of Corporate Affairs, and it only takes a few minutes to renew the code.</p>
<p>When extending the validity, we also submit updated data to the register. You can read more about LEI codes renewal and data change <strong><a href="/legal-entity-indentifiers-renewing-your-lei-number/">here</a></strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Would you like to extend the LEI code?</strong></p>
                    </main>
        <footer class="modal__footer">
          <button
            class="btn modal__btn modal__btn-primary js-continue-to-flow js-continue-as-renew">Yes</button>
          <button class="btn modal__btn" data-micromodal-close
                  aria-label="Close this dialog window">No          </button>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

